Scope
-----
This license applies to the entire contents of this repository, including:
  - the source code (e.g. `app.py`, `main.py`, `src/`, `templates/`, `static/`),
  - the experimental dataset in `data/` (including `data/dataset.csv`),
  - the pre-trained model artifacts in `models/` (`*.pkl`), and
  - the figures and diagrams in `docs/`,
together with any derived or modified versions of them.

